g or small, all at your disposal\r\n\u25cf Reading model: Daytime Mode and Night Mode for you to choose,you can enjoy an easy read at any time\r\n\u25cf Build Your Own Library: enjoy your favorites in your own world\r\n\r\nThe subscription would be renewed automatically within 24 hours before the date of expiration. Both sides can turn off this service. Once the service is turned off, the charging will stop, but the already completed payment won't be returned .\r\n5.How to cancel the subscription:\r\n1) Open the Setting app.\r\n2) Tap your name.\r\n3) Tap Subscriptions.\r\n4) Select Novelfull.\r\n5) Tap Cancel Subscription.\r\n6.Privacy Policy:https://stat.5gnovel.com/privacy-policy.text\r\n7.Term of service:https://stat.5gnovel.com/user_greement.text\r\n\r\nJoin Novelfull, more benefits and functions waiting for you in the near future!",
